{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57508","headline":"相重诗 · 无名氏","name":"相重诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驱马清渭滨，飞镳犯夕尘。\n川波张远盖，山日下遥轮。\n柳叶眉行尽，桃花骑转新。\n（自《平头诗》以下二十八题均见《文镜秘府论》西卷《文二十八种病》）（按：《文二十八种病》节，爲弘法大师综合刘善经、元兢、崔融及《文笔式》等诸家之说而成。\n所引作品，可考知者有六朝及初唐人之作，多数爲作者无考之佚诗佚句。\n今将可考知出某家着作所引者另录，余皆附於此，虽难定时代，爲六朝至初唐人作则无问题。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}